8. Risk Planning

Potential risks include:

Incorrect or outdated legal information.
AI-generated responses containing errors.
Data-security problems.
Database failures.
Internet/API dependency.
Difficulty integrating AI with the application.
Changes in laws and regulations.
Risk Mitigation
Prefer verified and official legal sources.
Display source information where appropriate.
Regularly update the legal database.
Use secure authentication and data handling.
Test AI responses with representative queries.
Clearly inform users that the system provides general information.
